Section 2: Definitions: In this Ordinance, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context:
(a) 'Banking Court' means a Banking Court established under section 4;
(b) 'customer' means a person to whom finance has been extended by a financial institution;
(c) 'financial institution' means any bank or development finance institution;
(d) 'finance' includes any accommodation or facility provided on basis of participation in profit and loss, markup, lease, hire-purchase, or loan;
(e) 'obligation' includes any sum payable to a financial institution under a contract or decree.
